Subject: [PATCH 12/21] Oi review 2/5 strip tool: respect sampler interpolation
 (CUBICSPLINE dropped only with zero tangents), keep
 sparse/normalized/non-float outputs; test with Oi's counterexample +
 byte-identical regeneration of the room GLB from 1c21428

(cherry picked from commit 1eeae1883cab5bb7d7649850a5483147ad2cb67a)
---
 tools/size/strip-rest-anim-channels.cjs       | 10 +++++--
 .../test_strip_rest_anim_interpolation.cjs    | 28 +++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 35 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
